# Build Log

Update `BUILD_LOG.md` in the same turn as any meaningful change: product decisions, implementation, docs, verification, dead ends, or scope cuts.

- Follow the existing section structure. Add dated bullets; do not wipe prior entries.
- Log the **why**, not a file dump. Include alternatives considered when a decision forked.
- Record what was tested, what was not, and known limitations.
- If a change is too small for a new decision, still add a one-line note under the relevant section.
- Never finish a task with an outdated build log.
